  "keyFeatures": [
    "Hybrid kernel with monolithic core and modular loadable services",
    "Dual-target: native bare metal (x86_64, ARM) and browser WASM/WASI runtime",
    "BPE/U (Browser Processing Engine/Unit) virtual CPU for browser execution",
    "Agentic runtime with sandboxed AI agent execution",
    "Modern desktop UI with macOS/Fluent hybrid aesthetics",
    "Persistent authentication surviving browser cache clear (OPFS + WebCrypto)",
    "Real boot sequence: BIOS POST → Bootloader → Kernel → Login",
    "Complete userland: shell, coreutils, package manager",
    "Built-in applications: Terminal, Files, Browser, Weather, Notes, Tasks, Music",
    "GPU-accelerated animations at 60fps with Material Design interactions"
  ],
